    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a bold move that seeks to reshape Kenya's approach to mental health, Professor Lukoye Atwoli, Dean at the Medical College of East Africa and Associate Director of the Brain and Mind Institute at AKU has launched a petition with the National Assembly to decriminalize attempted suicide. His call for change is grounded in a deep understanding of mental health and a passionate plea for compassion over criminalization.",
